# Hoarder's Overflow: one ability, two trigger conditions (CR 603.2). Black Lotus is a free spell, the Overflow mana 1-2 and
# enters with a stash counter; a Lightning Bolt is mana 3 and a second, off the Mountain, mana 4 - its controller expends 4
# (CR 700.14) and it gets a second. On turn three, {1}{R} and sacrificing it discard the hand (Memnite and a Mountain) and
# draw cards equal to the two stash counters it had as it was sacrificed (CR 608.2h). The third mana adds no counter, and
# another permanent entering (the Mountain) doesn't trigger it.

